<title>BELGIUM: GBL to release H1 96 earnings Wednesday.</title>
<headline>GBL to release H1 96 earnings Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Groupe Bruxelles Lambert SA (GBL) said its will release 1996 first-half earnings on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
